# Morpheus-Marketplace-APP — Amplify two-branch flow

This repo is **strategy C** in `~/.cursor/rules/git-and-github-workflow.mdc`.

- Long-lived branches: **`dev`** and **`main` only** (no `test`).
- Both deploy via **AWS Amplify**.
- Path: **`feat|fix|…` → `dev` → `main`**.
- Agent may open and **merge PRs into `dev`** when ready.
- Agent may open **`dev` → `main`**, then **WAIT** — never merge to `main` without explicit user approval.
- Branch topic work from `origin/dev`; never push directly to `dev` / `main`.
